b. Credit Party Verification

Validate status of an account for a given payer and transaction type. 
The id of the payer and transaction type must be supplied.

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/credit-party-verification
{
    "receiver": {
		"serviceId": "1",
		"msisdn": "",
        "bankAccountNumber": "",
		"businessRegisteredName": "",
		"payerId": "9",
		"bic" : "",
		"transactionType": "C2C"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": ""
}

To Thunes:
POST: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/payers/{id}/{transaction_type}/credit-party-verification

Request - For C2C or B2C transaction type.
{
  "credit_party_identifier": {
    "bank_account_number": "",
    "msisdn": "254101010000",
    "payer_id": "9",
    "swift_bic_code": "",
    "transaction_type": "C2C"
  },
  "receiving_business": {
    "registered_name": ""
  }
}

Request - For C2B or B2B transaction type.
{
  "credit_party_identifier": {
    "bank_account_number": "624101010100",
    "msisdn": "",
    "payer_id": "4715",
    "swift_bic_code": "",
    "transaction_type": "C2B"
  },
  "receiving_business": {
    "registered_name": "ADS Canadian Bank"
  }
}


Thunes Response:

{
    "id": 31,
    "account_status": "AVAILABLE"
}
